, R0055\n\n### Q5: Best Run per Board Family\n- **Selection criteria**: Primary = highest yield (`fp_yield_pct`), secondary = lowest defect count, tertiary = highest throughput (`boards_per_min`), tiebreak = lexicographic `run_id`.\n- **Results**:\n  - Compute_IO → R0002 (100% yield)\n  - Industrial_CTRL → R0022 (97.92%)\n  - Mobile_PWR → R0007 (97.26%)\n  - RF_FrontEnd → R0031 (97.40%)\n  - Sensor_Module → R0026 (97.31%)\n  - Wearable → R0050 (100% yield)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":371,"cache_read_input_tokens":108610,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":371,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1}},"requestId":"req_vrtx_011CXtDawxbJTwwaTSBAJhEj","type":"assistant","uuid":"1dd529ab-374a-44f4-888f-8803c80ef575","timestamp":"2026-02-07T06:15:21.723Z"}
